      hu: ["A templom 12 méter magas.", "Hossza 16 méter, szélessége 10 méter.", "A belső térben 8 oszlop található.", "A homlokzaton 5 ablak van.", "A szomszédos templomba vezető alagút 20 méter hosszú.", "Az építkezés 1187 körül kezdődött."],
      ro: ["Biserica are 12 metri înălțime.", "Lungimea este de 16 metri, lățimea de 10 metri.", "Interiorul are 8 coloane.", "Fațada are 5 ferestre.", "Tunelul către biserica vecină are 20 de metri.", "Construcția a început în jurul anului 1187."],
      en: ["The church is 12 meters high.", "It is 16 meters long and 10 meters wide.", "The interior has 8 pillars.", "The facade has 5 windows.", "The tunnel to the neighboring church is 20 meters long.", "Construction began around 1187."],
